    "# Philippines Cyclone Agaton: Damage and Flood Proxy Maps, Apr 2022 The **Earth Observatory of Singapore – Remote Sensing Lab (EOS-RS)** produced these damage and flood proxy maps for Philippines Cyclone Agaton (Apr 2022) from synthetic aperture radar (SAR) satellite images. Each map is a separate ZIP below with its GeoTIFF, a KMZ for Google Earth, the PNG figures and a text file describing how it was made and how to read it. ## Maps in this dataset - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Philippines, Bagyong Agaton (Megi), Abril 2022, v0.4 wbd** - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Philippines, Bagyong Agaton (Megi), Abril 2022, v0.4** (superseded) - **EOS-RS Flood Proxy Map: Philippines, Bagyong Agaton (Megi), Abril 2022, v0.4** **More map details and files:**"
